        <mxCell id="XD3rxm2rLfgqVbCXmS1k-3" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#5C4207;strokeColor=#D4AF65;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#F6E7B0;fontSize=17;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;" value="主頁不直接攤開雙方細節。只有 mismatch 時顯示 conflict box；點擊後才進 detail page 比較 Firmware 與 Central。" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="54" width="1160" x="220" y="98" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="XD3rxm2rLfgqVbCXmS1k-38" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F9FAFB;strokeColor=#B8BEC8;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#374151;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=10;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;中英對照 / Bilingual Glossary&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 1.22;&quot;&gt;Telemetry 與 Roster 可見性&lt;br&gt;Telemetry &amp;amp; Roster Visibility&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;App 只在 Firmware 與 Central 不一致時顯示衝突入口&lt;br&gt;App only shows a conflict entry when Firmware and Central disagree&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;主頁不直接攤開雙方細節。只有 mismatch 時顯示 conflict box；點擊後才進 detail page 比較 Firmware 與 Central。&lt;br&gt;The main page does not expand both sides directly. It only shows a conflict box on mismatch; tapping it opens a detail page to compare Firmware and Central.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;第一手 runtime observation&lt;br&gt;First-hand runtime observation&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;權威 metadata 與 sync&lt;br&gt;Authoritative metadata and sync&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;衝突入口 gate&lt;br&gt;Conflict-entry gate&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;點擊後才看雙方細節&lt;br&gt;Only view both sides after tapping&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;衝突入口只在不一致時出現。主頁不直接攤開雙方細節，點入 detail page 才比較 Firmware 與 Central。&lt;br&gt;The conflict entry only appears on mismatch. The main page does not expand both sides directly; users compare Firmware and Central only in the detail page.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;實際狀態 != 指派預期&lt;br&gt;runtime != assignment&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;現場名單 != 中央名冊&lt;br&gt;ROSTER != inventory&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;欄位稀疏 != 錯誤 / 資料遺失&lt;br&gt;sparse != error / data loss&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
